  "description": "Revered by his comrades, Seo Seung-Bum was once a man of unwavering strength. But when Hwang Jii-Hyuk uncovers his darkest secret, Seung-Bum becomes powerless against him. Stripped of control, he is forced into a world of torment—drugged, violated, and reshaped under the guise of twisted pleasure. As Ji-Hyuk’s cruel obsession spirals deeper, Seung-Bum struggles to grasp what his captor truly wants. Trapped in a cycle of pain and desire, he fights to survive each day… not knowing if escape is even possible.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
